# Voice agent card

Active work is the **homepage** live demo in `components/landing/voice-agent-card.tsx`, rendered from `components/landing/case-studies.tsx` when `project.slug === 'ai-voice-agents'`.

Do not change other landing sections, `/demo/voice-agent` (mock), or `VOICE-FOR-WEBSITE/` unless asked.

## Integration

- SDK: `sarvam-conv-ai-sdk/browser` (`ConversationAgent`, `BrowserAudioInterface`)
- IDs and rates: `lib/sarvam.ts`. Client `baseUrl` is `/api/sarvam/` with dummy `apiKey: "proxied"`.
- Agent: Riya (`handler_name`). Always `stop()` on end/unmount.

## Done / do not revert

- **driver.js is removed.** Do not add tours, IntersectionObserver popovers, or the `driver.js` package.

The card is wrapped in a `Link` to `/demo/voice-agent`; Talk/End must keep `preventDefault()`.
